1. OFFICIAL PROBLEM STATEMENT — SOURCE OF TRUTH
==================================================

VERTICAL:
Elderly Care & Medication Management Platform.

OFFICIAL CHALLENGE:

Develop a smart, interconnected healthcare management platform designed to help elderly individuals manage their daily medications, medical appointments and healthcare routines while keeping their family members and caretakers informed.

The platform must provide a shared ecosystem where elderly individuals, caretakers and family members can access and manage an elderly person's healthcare profile through secure, passcode-based access.

Authorized members should be able to:
- View healthcare profiles.
- Add, edit and manage medication schedules.
- Track medication adherence.
- Monitor upcoming doctor appointments.
- Coordinate healthcare routines.

The system should proactively send email reminders for:
- Missed or unconfirmed medications.
- Upcoming medication doses.
- Medical appointments.

The challenge requires more than a basic reminder application.

The solution must demonstrate innovation, accessibility, reliability and collaboration while keeping elderly individuals at the centre of their own healthcare decisions.

EVERY CORE FEATURE MUST MAP TO THIS PROBLEM STATEMENT.

